      "title": "gsm_a_common: Fix dissection of IMSI with even number of digits",
      "message": "gsm_a_common: Fix dissection of IMSI with even number of digits\n\nPreviously if the filler was not 0xf then it was incorrectly added to\nIMSI digits.\n",
      "author_name": "Vasil Velichkov",
